# Kill a tabaxi, eat its corpse, and photograph the patron's favour either
# side of the meal. Read by tools/check_favour_awards.sh, bd inc-rgzr.
#
# NOT RUN ON ITS OWN. tools/keys/favour-devour-khasrach.keys and
# tools/keys/favour-devour-zurvash.keys enter wizard mode, make their god the
# patron, and then @include this file. The god is the only difference.
#
# Creature::DevourMonster (src/Skills.cpp) pays Khasrach 10 * CR for a SAPIENT
# corpse and Zurvash 5 * CR for any corpse. A tabaxi is sapient (INT 12, not an
# animal, not mindless) and CR 2 (lib/mon2.irh). It is the control of
# tools/keys/devour-negative-cr.keys for the same reason: an ordinary corpse
# that a wizard-mode summon can supply by name.
#
# THREE SHEETS, because the kill and the meal are separate events:
#
#   favour-champion   after Become Divine Champion
#   favour-killed     after the kill, before the meal
#   favour-ate        after the meal
#
# Only the last two bracket the award. The kill sits outside them because
# Khasrach's script pays for kills too (GODWATCH(POST(EV_DEATH)),
# lib/religion.irh), through the dispatcher path that never had this defect.
#
# THE IDIOMS, all borrowed from tools/keys/devour-negative-cr.keys:
#
#   Freeze Monsters      the eleventh row of the Wizard Mode Switches, so the
#                        tabaxi does not fight back.
#   RIGHT ENTER          summon it one square east.
#   @while "Confirm      a freshly summoned tabaxi is not yet hostile, so the
#     attack" y          first blow asks.
#   @until "tabaxi       swing until its corpse is listed. SPACE comes first
#     corpse" SPACE      in each pass because the first blow can raise a box
#     RIGHT              of alignment messages, and RIGHT does not dismiss it.
#   @until "What do      step onto the corpse and press e until the eat menu
#     you want to eat" e is up. The step can raise boxes first -- "You see
#                        here:", and on some seeds a rune-covered weapon being
#                        identified -- and each swallows one key. Lowercase e:
#                        see that script.

w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10
SPACE
ESC

d
DOWN*20
@dump:favour-champion
ESC

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Cats"
@choose "tabaxi"
RIGHT
ENTER

RIGHT
@while "Confirm attack" y
@until "tabaxi corpse" SPACE RIGHT
@dump:killed
@while "more --" SPACE

d
DOWN*20
@dump:favour-killed
ESC

RIGHT
@until "What do you want to eat" e
@choose "(ground) tabaxi corpse"
@while "Stop eating" n
@dump:ate
@while "more --" SPACE

d
DOWN*20
@dump:favour-ate
ESC

v
@dump:messages
@while "Messages" ESC
